  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Fixed Wireless and Fiber Access Network Expansion, through Innovation Network LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant funds a feasibility study (Study) to assess the economic and technical viability of expanding Converged Technology Networks Limited&apos;s fixed wireless and fiber access networks to underserved small and medium enterprises as well as private households across Malawi. U.S. firm Connectivity Capital LLC will carry out the Study on a sole-source basis.</narrative>
  </description>
